  <description>
    <p>
      RWKV Studio is a desktop application for running, managing, and integrating
      RWKV and OpenAI-compatible models with local-first workflows.
    </p>
    <p>
      It combines chat, text generation, model lifecycle management, MCP
      connectivity, workflow editing, and local service integration in one UI.
    </p>
  </description>
